# Claude Code Integration

This directory is the isolated Claude Code adapter shelf for this repository's embedded operating copy.

The repository keeps the shared operating memory, project bindings, and Codex skill originals. Claude-specific files live here so they do not mix with the Codex skill package tree under `codex/skills/`.

## Boundaries

- `codex/skills/` remains the Codex skill source tree.
- `integrations/claude-code/` contains only Claude adapter docs, templates, manifests, and sync tooling.
- Generated Claude discovery files are written to a consuming project `.claude/skills/` folder or to `~/.claude/skills/`.
- The sync tool reads local skill frontmatter and writes thin Claude wrappers. It does not modify skill originals.
- Use a manifest allowlist for each project; do not expose every skill to Claude automatically.

## Files

- `claude-code-bridge.md`: reader model, ownership rules, and workflow.
- `sync-cubelessops-skills.ps1`: wrapper generator.
- `templates/skill-wrapper.SKILL.md`: generated wrapper template.
- `manifests/*.skills.json`: project allowlists.

## CubelessStylized

From the repository root:

```powershell
pwsh .\codex\integrations\claude-code\sync-cubelessops-skills.ps1 -ProjectRoot .
```

The default manifest is selected from the consuming project folder name, for example `manifests/CubelessStylized.skills.json`.
